<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae confirms no plans for Tafisa buyout.</title>
<headline>Sonae confirms no plans for Tafisa buyout.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wood products group Sonae Industria confirmed on Tuesday that it had no plans to launch a buyout of its Spanish subsidiary Tafisa.</p>
<p>&quot;The board of Sonae informs that, contrary to what some press reports state, it has no intention whatsoever of launching a public offer to buy (OPA) for Tafisa.&quot;</p>
<p>Sonae Industria holds 49.97 percent of Tafisa. The Spanish company had already denied that Sonae was planning a bid.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
